Set Theory Game engine changes on top of lean4game v4.35.0, as one patch.
Generated with `git diff v4.35.0 stg4-ui` from our lean4game fork (branch stg4-ui at ae9b53c), which has these commits:

  c483467 fix: don't spin forever when the Lean session is lost; stop image jitter
  04a2017 fix: typewriter feedback after a failed command; keep the world image visible
  641ded0 Use the single-panel layout below 1024px; hide inactive mobile panels
  92684de Fit the layout to the visible viewport and the on-screen keyboard
  a7dcb7c Route every UI colour through CSS colour tokens
  1ffc47f Add a dark colour palette
  3b213a3 Add a theme preference and apply it to the page, MUI and Monaco
  a76e9be Add an Appearance setting to the preferences popup
  d50dffd Show hints button, completion message and Next on mobile
  18010ee Mobile level: Proof | Inventory switch, Prev/Next in the app bar
  be52e27 Make the world map usable on touch screens
  8781915 Fit popups to small screens
  c5dd904 Mobile readability: scrolling docs, taller inventory rows, wrapped errors
  ed78271 Don't show "undefined" in the level title while the level loads
  03eaf0e Switch the command line editor's theme when the theme changes
  5bfff82 Keep desktop app bar height; fit the preferences slider on phones
  9479722 Mobile inventory: one scrolling column instead of wrapping into columns
  b9d2e86 Merge ui-responsive: phone and tablet layout
  530a80c Merge ui-darkmode: colour tokens and dark mode
  a0f914f fix: make level navigation and submitting commands reliable
  ae9b53c feat: a more modern look, Set Theory Game branding, operator-provided legal pages

