+## Privacy Policy
+
+Our server collects metadata (such as IP address, browser, operating system) and the data that
+you enter into the editor. The data is used to compute the Lean output and display it to you.
+The information is kept while you are on the website and deleted immediately afterwards. We keep
+logs to improve our software, but the data in them is anonymized.
+
+We do not use cookies, but your game progress is stored in the browser as site data. Your game
+progress is not saved on the server; if you delete your browser storage, it is completely gone.
+
+Our server is located in [country].
+
+**Contact:**\
+[Name]\
+[Postal address]\
+[Email address]
+
+*This is a placeholder: whoever runs this site must check this policy and fill in the details
+above, in `client/public/legal/privacy.md`.*
